<title>CHINA: Siemens in 300 mln mark China power deal.</title>
<headline>Siemens in 300 mln mark China power deal.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A subsidiary of German electrical giant Siemens AG signed a 300 million mark ($183 million) deal on Monday to supply China with power transmission equipment, officials said.</p>
</text>
